        "copyStep": "[Observed] at this version's drafting no file implements the copy step, its Git environment or the copy's directory, which typedAuthority.fetch, readAuthority, tags and stateDirectoryWrites declare for a copy-class run; the reader implements those declarations only as they concern the clone it reads objects from. The copy step is the launch step's (REQ-polaris-generation-047), which no implementation authorization covers yet. [Inferred] Until it is implemented and authorized, no run makes a copy"
      },
      "contractId": "RFC-0004/general-contract",
      "contractVersion": "sha256:b21fc950103964c34e2f9b2d78c97ac8e03720f311738e0e6323afb29b8d6f0e",
