        "id": "polaris-manifesto-generation",
        "version": "the generation specification bytes in force at the signing commit: base REQ-polaris-generation-017 and 025, the understanding and tree-form amendments, and REQ-polaris-generation-033 to 036 of the version-tagged sign-off polaris-dossier-local-agent-mode-v1.0",
