      "authorizationModeDerivation": "every read needs this entry in force, the pair's effective observation consent naming the pinned revision, and the effective classification and public-source screening policy acts; owner-trusted-bootstrap while those acts are state (1); every other combination refuses before any object is read",
      "provenanceDisclosure": "Reads are admitted on owner-trusted records; independent audit is not configured. The operator's clone, its .git directory and every record the gates read lie within the operator's agent sessions' write reach; only object bytes that re-hash to the identifier they were reached by are used",
